Name: NVidia Control X Extension Library
Short Name: libXNVCtrl
URL: https://github.com/NVIDIA/nvidia-settings
Revision: f8cb90d08f42c9c475bab5d7fa99108b0374bdae
Version: N/A
Date: 2012-06-16
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
This package provides access to NVidia Control X Extension. It is used to determine the version of the NVIDIA driver in use.

The current version is pulled from nvidia-settings-302.17.

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./

Local Modifications:
- patches/0001-const-extension-name.patch: declares
  nvctrl_extension_name const.
- patches/0002-c23-prototypes.patch: gives close_display() and
  wire_to_event() full prototypes so the file compiles as C23.
